instant_sort_by_label_closed_header_skipped_label_tie_break
required_capability: promql_command_v0
required_capability: promql_instant_query
required_capability: promql_sort_by_label
// "pod" is not in the closed header, so it is skipped; remaining identity (cluster) is the tie-break.
PROMQL index=k8s time="2024-05-10T00:03:00.000Z" bytes=(sort_by_label(avg by (cluster) (last_over_time(network.bytes_in[1m])), "pod"));

bytes:double | step:datetime            | cluster:keyword
612.0        | 2024-05-10T00:03:00.000Z | prod
749.0        | 2024-05-10T00:03:00.000Z | qa
382.5        | 2024-05-10T00:03:00.000Z | staging
;

